      "side": 1,
      "message": "Observed that the ADL-N RVP board was failing to boot to OS with ToT EC image having the following traces on EC console.\n\n22-07-22 23:12:52.357 --- UART initialized after reboot ---\n22-07-22 23:12:52.361 [Image: RO, adlrvpm_ite_1.1.9999-3ffc37b adlrvpm_ite_14990.0.22_07_22  @up-NUC7i7BNH]\n22-07-22 23:12:52.365 [Reset cause: reset-pin power-on]\n22-07-22 23:12:53.447 Pre-WDT warning! IPC:0000299e LP:000029ae TASK_ID:255\n22-07-22 23:12:53.481 Pre-WDT warning! IPC:0000299e LP:000029ae TASK_ID:255\n22-07-22 23:12:53.510 Pre-WDT warning! IPC:0000299e LP:000029ae TASK_ID:255\n22-07-22 23:12:53.540 Pre-WDT warning! IPC:0000299e LP:000029ae TASK_ID:255\n\nThis was regression and when tried to bisect the failure, found that CL https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/3761356 was causing the regression.\n\nBy disabling LTO for adlrvpm_ite board we are still able to see enough flash memory available and also able to boot ADL-N RVP board to OS successfully.",
